    label: 'Bubble Tea',
    description: 'This is where BBTea.sg started. We track milk teas, fruit teas, brown sugar boba, cheese foam drinks, outlet details, and the brands people actually look for.',
    accent: 'var(--color-taro-400)',
    bg: 'var(--color-blush-100)',
  },
  {
    icon: `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 8.25v7.5m12-7.5v7.5M3 8.25h18M3 15.75h18M6 8.25C6 5.904 8.686 4 12 4s6 1.904 6 4.25M3 8.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 6h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 8.25"/>
    </svg>`,
    label: 'Coffee',
    description: 'Singapore has always taken coffee seriously. We cover kopitiam kopi, specialty roasters, quiet work cafes, and the places locals keep going back to.',
    accent: 'var(--color-boba-400)',
    bg: '#FDF6EE',
  },
  {
    icon: `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 21v-7.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75V21m-4.5 0H2.36m11.14 0H18m0 0h3.64m-1.39 0V9.349M3.75 21V9.349m0 0a3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75-.615A2.993 2.993 0 0 0 9.75 9.75c.896 0 1.7-.393 2.25-1.016a2.993 2.993 0 0 0 2.25 1.016 2.993 2.993 0 0 0 2.25-1.016 3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75.614m-16.5 0a3.004 3.004 0 0 1-.621-4.72l1.189-1.19A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.378 3h13.243a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.06.44l1.19 1.189a3 3 0 0 1-.621 4.72M6.75 18h3.75a.75.75 0 0 0 .75-.75V13.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75H6.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v3.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75Z"/>
    </svg>`,
    label: 'Cafes',
    description: "Some days you want brunch. Some days you want a laptop corner, a proper matcha, or somewhere calm after a long week. We keep those finds easy to browse.",
    accent: 'var(--color-forest-700)',
    bg: 'var(--color-cream-100)',
  },
